            <history xml:id="history_id1fce317e">
               <p xml:id="idm83">Clara Montû was the eldest daughter of the German merchant Heinrich von Ohlendorff and his wife Elisabeth. In 1879 she had married Hugo Montû and moved to  Hannover and later to GroßSaalau in West Prussia (now Poland). Gade stayed with the Ohlendorff family several times when he visited Hamburg.</p>
